1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:01,360
You mention shoes once,

2
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,520
and suddenly your whole feed is shoes.

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,040
Is Instagram listening?

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,480
Instagram says no.

5
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:06,960
Instead,

6
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,160
it's keeping score.

7
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:08,880
Every like,

8
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:09,440
save,

9
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:10,960
share and comment is a point for

10
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:11,840
that topic.

11
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,680
It also tries to predict whether you'll

12
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,880
linger on a post,

13
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,640
so lingering is a clue too.

14
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:18,240
Then it spots what lots of people

15
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,440
are loving right now,

16
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:20,640
and tests it on you.

17
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,320
Ads can even use your shopping on

18
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,040
other sites,

19
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,320
if those sites share it.

20
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,000
So it's not a mind reader.

21
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,920
It's a very patient note-taker.

22
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,440
Makes you wonder what your thumb has

23
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:30,689
been telling it.

24
00:00:32,667 --> 00:00:33,067
Like,

25
00:00:33,067 --> 00:00:33,467
share,

26
00:00:33,467 --> 00:00:36,357
and subscribe for more bad ideas.
